[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_0a087")
dialogue_id = "debate_lost_history"
record_title = "Debate Speech: A Shard That Forgot Its History"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: We recently heard from a shard where the gate has malfunctioned for generations, leaving its people marooned.
scribe: Those isolated souls believe themselves to be entirely alone in the void, having forgotten the other shards and the true history of our world.
scribe: When a community is severed from our shared story, the steady march of generations inevitably erases an uncomfortable past.
scribe: The Historian and I are in complete agreement that the follies of our ancestors must not be forgotten.
scribe: Where we differ is that I am unwilling to gamble with so solemn a duty.
scribe: When every village is left to write its own history, they will always cast themselves as the victims, never the architects of their own ruin.
scribe: By binding ourselves to the Enlightened One's teachings, we prevent our descendants from editing their way into another apocalypse."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
